# A change here needs the owner's approving review before it merges (the
# ruleset on main requires code-owner review). These are the merge judge and
# the hard guards: a PR's own checks run its own copy of the workflows, of the
# gate script (check `gate`) and of contract.py with the modules it imports
# (check `contract`); a session runs under the hooks and the settings, acts
# through the identity script, and the diagnose model under its command
# whitelist; terraform's apply is a human maintenance act. The local agent
# App's PRs merge themselves everywhere else (docs/governance.md § Autonomy
# tiers).
/.github/                        @iengai
/.claude/hooks/                  @iengai
/.claude/settings*.json          @iengai
/.claude/skills/verify/          @iengai
/terraform/                      @iengai
/scripts/ops/contract.py         @iengai
/scripts/ops/fix_issue.py        @iengai
/scripts/ops/claude_harness.py   @iengai
/scripts/ops/diagnose_issue.py   @iengai
/scripts/ops/agent_identity.py   @iengai
